# Apple Intelligence / PCC / region probe / ChatGPT — bind to a user-selected
# supported-region proxy group (often a low-latency US node). Matchers only.
# No policy / proxy-group names.
#
# Official hosts (purpose only; Apple does NOT prescribe US proxy):
#   https://support.apple.com/en-us/101555  § Apple Intelligence, Siri, and Search
#   - apple-relay.cloudflare.com / apple-relay.fastly-edge.com / cp4.cloudflare.com
#       → Private Cloud Compute (PCC)
#   - apple-relay.apple.com → Apple Intelligence Extensions (e.g. ChatGPT)
# PCC architecture overview (not a domain allowlist):
#   https://security.apple.com/blog/private-cloud-compute/
#
# NOT Private Relay: iCloud Private Relay uses mask*.icloud.com / mask-api.icloud.com
# (same 101555 page, iCloud section). Those are intentionally omitted here to avoid
# conflating Private Relay with PCC and to avoid generic Apple/iCloud regressions.
#
# Removed vs older Apple-AI.list (regression / over-broad):
#   - guzzoni / smoot / DOMAIN-KEYWORD,siri → moved or dropped (see Apple-Siri-Direct.list)
#   - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com → too broad (Maps / other GeoServices)
#   - DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apps.mzstatic.com → App Store CDN catch-all
#   - mask* / gateway.icloud.com / probe|metrics.icloud.com → Private Relay / general iCloud
#
# --- Official PCC / Apple Intelligence Extensions (101555) ---
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.fastly-edge.com
# Official host is exact cp4.cloudflare.com (no *. prefix). Prefer DOMAIN over a broad
# Cloudflare catch; DOMAIN-SUFFIX,cloudflare.com must NEVER appear here.
DOMAIN,cp4.cloudflare.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,apple-relay.apple.com
#
# --- Community / maintained rules (NOT in Apple 101555 AI table) ---
# gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com — internet-based region / Geo Country Code probe (pep/gcc).
# Purpose: contextual/region lookup for many Apple services, not Siri voice itself.
# Community sources treat a supported-region egress as helpful for Apple Intelligence
# eligibility; this is NOT official must-US proof, and it can affect other services.
# Use exact DOMAIN — do not expand to DOMAIN-SUFFIX,ls.apple.com.
# Refs: https://gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com/pep/gcc
#       https://ruleset.isteed.cc/List/Source/AppleIntelligence.conf
#       https://nsringo.github.io/guide/GeoServices/location-service
#       https://github.com/Johnshall/Shadowrocket-ADBlock-Rules-Forever/issues/601
DOMAIN,gspe1-ssl.ls.apple.com
#
# UNCERTAIN: apple-relay.akamaized.net — present in prior Apple-AI.list / some screenshots;
# not listed in Apple 101555 AI/Siri table. Kept as exact DOMAIN only.
DOMAIN,apple-relay.akamaized.net
#
# --- ChatGPT / OpenAI (Apple Intelligence extension companion) ---
# Minimal core suffixes only. Do NOT import full OpenAI.list here (stripe/sentry/segment/
# auth0/algolia overlap Claude-AI.list and unrelated SaaS). Prefer a dedicated OpenAI
# RULE-SET if you need the full ChatGPT web surface.
# Maintained reference (broader): blackmatrix7 ios_rule_script OpenAI.list
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,openai.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,chatgpt.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaistatic.com
DOMAIN-SUFFIX,oaiusercontent.com
